OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to shut Marston's Brewery in
OL,4,ABurton revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarston's Brewery could close in
OL,7,FBurton-upon-Trent, under plans revealed
OL,8,Fby its owners.
OL,10,FCarlsberg Britvic said it was proposing
OL,11,Fto shut the facility together with its
OL,12,Fprimary logistics operation based at
OL,13,Fthat site next summer.
OL,15,FBurton-upon-Trent's connections with
OL,16,Fthe brewing industry date back
OL,17,Fcenturies, with the firm describing its
OL,18,Fown history and legacy in the town as
OL,19,F"iconic".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
